{"id":"95eae96cf5d7c8ff","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-pblocalimprovetermination.md","title":"严格一点改进路径的有限终止","display":"thm-pblocalimprovetermination — 严格一点改进路径的有限终止","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-pblocalimprovetermination","aliases":["27-thm-pblocalimprovetermination"],"display":"thm-pblocalimprovetermination — 严格一点改进路径的有限终止","depends_on":["[[27-df-pbunimodality]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"13.4.1","source_printed_pages":"586–587","source_pdf_pages":"610–611","verification_status":"source-statement-checked-and-local-argument"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-pblocalimprovetermination"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-pblocalimprovetermination</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-pblocalimprovetermination — 严格一点改进路径的有限终止"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a80118b233c9c7df\" href=\"?note=a80118b233c9c7df\" title=\"27-df-pbunimodality\">27-df-pbunimodality</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"13.4.1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"586–587"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"610–611"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked-and-local-argument"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\mathbb R\">\\(f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\mathbb R\\)</span> 不必单射；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d,\\mathrm{LM}\">\\(d,\\mathrm{LM}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a80118b233c9c7df\" href=\"?note=a80118b233c9c7df\" title=\"27-df-pbunimodality\">27-df-pbunimodality</a> 的形式定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(q\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x^0,\\ldots,x^q\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\">\\(x^0,\\ldots,x^q\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall k\\in\\{j\\in\\mathbb N:j&lt;q\\}\\;(d(x^k,x^{k+1})=1\\land f(x^{k+1})&gt;f(x^k))\">\\(\\forall k\\in\\{j\\in\\mathbb N:j&lt;q\\}\\;(d(x^k,x^{k+1})=1\\land f(x^{k+1})&gt;f(x^k))\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"q\\le2^n-1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[q\\le2^n-1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\left(\\forall y\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;(d(x^q,y)=1\\Longrightarrow f(y)\\le f(x^q))\\right)\n\\Longrightarrow x^q\\in\\mathrm{LM}(f,\\{0,1\\}^n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\left(\\forall y\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;(d(x^q,y)=1\\Longrightarrow f(y)\\le f(x^q))\\right)\n\\Longrightarrow x^q\\in\\mathrm{LM}(f,\\{0,1\\}^n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;\\exists q\\in\\{0,\\ldots,2^n-1\\}\\;\\exists(x^0,\\ldots,x^q)\\in(\\{0,1\\}^n)^{\\{0,\\ldots,q\\}}\\quad\n\\left(x^0=a\\land\\bigwedge_{k=0}^{q-1}(d(x^k,x^{k+1})=1\\land f(x^{k+1})&gt;f(x^k))\\land x^q\\in\\mathrm{LM}(f,\\{0,1\\}^n)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;\\exists q\\in\\{0,\\ldots,2^n-1\\}\\;\\exists(x^0,\\ldots,x^q)\\in(\\{0,1\\}^n)^{\\{0,\\ldots,q\\}}\\quad\n\\left(x^0=a\\land\\bigwedge_{k=0}^{q-1}(d(x^k,x^{k+1})=1\\land f(x^{k+1})&gt;f(x^k))\\land x^q\\in\\mathrm{LM}(f,\\{0,1\\}^n)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>严格改进不能重复顶点，故最多2^n−1步。从任意指定起点，只要有更好邻居就选一个；有限性保证最终没有更好邻居，正是局部极大定义。这里只保证有限、允许指数界，不推出多项式时间或全局最优。LM的集合构造本身不使用单射，因此本条允许有并列值。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-pbunimodality","status":"resolved","id":"a80118b233c9c7df","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-pbunimodality]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pbunimodality","status":"resolved","id":"a80118b233c9c7df","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\mathbb R$ 不必单射；$d,\\mathrm{LM}$ 见 [[27-df-pbunimodality]] 的形式定义。$q\\in\\mathbb N$，$x^0,\\ldots,x^q\\in\\{0,1\\}^n$ 且 $\\forall k\\in\\{j\\in\\mathbb N:j<q\\}\\;(d(x^k,x^{k+1})=1\\land f(x^{k+1})>f(x^k))$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"d,\\mathrm{LM}","display":false},{"tex":"q\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"x^0,\\ldots,x^q\\in\\{0,1\\}^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall k\\in\\{j\\in\\mathbb N:j<q\\}\\;(d(x^k,x^{k+1})=1\\land f(x^{k+1})>f(x^k))","display":false},{"tex":"q\\le2^n-1.","display":true},{"tex":"\\left(\\forall y\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;(d(x^q,y)=1\\Longrightarrow f(y)\\le f(x^q))\\right)\n\\Longrightarrow x^q\\in\\mathrm{LM}(f,\\{0,1\\}^n).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;\\exists q\\in\\{0,\\ldots,2^n-1\\}\\;\\exists(x^0,\\ldots,x^q)\\in(\\{0,1\\}^n)^{\\{0,\\ldots,q\\}}\\quad\n\\left(x^0=a\\land\\bigwedge_{k=0}^{q-1}(d(x^k,x^{k+1})=1\\land f(x^{k+1})>f(x^k))\\land x^q\\in\\mathrm{LM}(f,\\{0,1\\}^n)\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1764,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-137","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-pblocalimprovetermination|thm-pblocalimprovetermination — 严格一点改进路径的有限终止]]"}],"outgoing":["a80118b233c9c7df"]}